Gate mix: 2 ACCEPT, 1 correct MODIFY (partnered-neg, in-window), 1 incorrect MODIFY (stale-sample / lagged-tag), 1 correct REJECT. Provenance: designed×3, simulated×1, hil×1 (Knead-Dene KD-HIL compounder bench). Intra-batch Jaccard on `state.description` {jmax:.3f} (max vs prior staged {jprior:.3f}).